== Effects ==
* Adds a chance to shoot [[Status Effects#Effects|fear tears]].
* {{dlc|nr}} {{tear delay down|1}}
* {{dlc|r}} +0.5 [[fire rate]].
* {{transformation contribution|Yes Mother?}}

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|a+}} This item has a 1% chance to spawn when bombing {{m|Mom's Dressing Table}}. Multiple copies can be obtained through this method.{{dlc-}}
* Fear tear effect depends on the [[luck]] stat, and the formula used to determine the chance is: <math>\frac{15}{100 - \left \lfloor \mathit{Luck} \right \rfloor}</math>
** At base luck (0), the chance is 15%, maxing out at 100% at 85 luck.
** {{i|Dark Matter}} is significantly better at inflicting fear than Mom's Perfume.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Compound Fracture}} / {{i|Cricket's Body}} / {{i|Haemolacria}} / {{i|The Parasite}}: If the main tear causes fear, the split tears cause fear too.
* {{I|Finger!}}: Finger can also apply the fear effect.
* {{i|Lachryphagy}}: If a fear tear is fed, all burst tears cause fear. If a normal tear is fed, the burst tears cannot cause fear.
* {{I|The Ludovico Technique}}: The tear flickers yellow, capable of inflicting fear when it does.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Abaddon}}: The chance to inflict fear does not stack.
* {{Dlc|nr}} '''Mom's Perfume''': Tear delay down does not stack.

